## Interface: 20505
## Title: SPHelper - Shadow Priest HUD
## Notes: Cast bar with Mind Flay clip, multi-target DoT tracker, and rotation advisor for TBC Shadow Priests.
## Author: Copilot
## Version: 2.0.0
## SavedVariables: SPHelperDB

# Core must load first
Core.lua
SpellDatabase.lua
TalentDatabase.lua

# Spec system (manager then validator, before helpers and specs)
SpecManager.lua
SpecValidator.lua
SpecTemplates.lua

# Helper modules (register themselves with SpecManager)
CastBar.lua
DotTracker.lua
Rotation.lua
RotationEngine.lua
ChannelHelper.lua
SpellData.lua
SpecUI.lua
Config.lua

# Spec files (register themselves with SpecManager at load time)
# To add a new spec:  create specs/ClassName_SpecName.lua, call
# SPHelper.SpecManager:RegisterSpec(spec), then list the file here.
# Load order: Core → SpecManager → SpecValidator → Helpers → SpecUI/Config → Specs
specs\Shadow_Priest.lua
specs\Druid_Balance.lua
specs\Feral_Druid.lua
specs\Hunter_BeastMastery.lua
specs\Hunter_Marksmanship.lua
specs\Hunter_Survival.lua
specs\Mage_Arcane.lua
specs\Mage_Fire.lua
specs\Mage_Frost.lua
specs\Paladin_Retribution.lua
specs\Rogue_Assassination.lua
specs\Rogue_Combat.lua
specs\Rogue_Subtlety.lua
specs\Shaman_Elemental.lua
specs\Shaman_Enhancement.lua
specs\Warlock_Affliction.lua
specs\Warlock_Demonology.lua
specs\Warlock_Demonology_Leveling.lua
specs\Warlock_Destruction.lua
specs\Warrior_Arms.lua
